    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let us fear therefore, lest haply, a promise being left of entering into his rest, any one of you should seem to have come short of it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For indeed we have had good tidings preached unto us, even as also they: but the word of hearing did not profit them, because it was not united by faith with them that heard. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For we who have believed do enter into that rest; even as he hath said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Having then a great high priest, who hath passed through the heavens, Jesus the Son of God, let us hold fast our confession. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For we have not a high priest that cannot be touched with the feeling of our infirmities; but one that hath been in all points tempted like as ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " without sin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let us therefore draw near with boldness unto the throne of grace, that we may receive mercy, and may find grace to help ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in time of need.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
